## `refute_goal_with`

``` hol4
Refute.refute_goal_with : config_update list -> goal -> outcome
```

The goal form of `refute_with`: `refute_goal_with updates goal`
abbreviates `refute_goal (current_config updates) goal`, applying the
updates to `!the_config` from left to right.
See [`Refute.refute_goal`](#Refute.refute_goal),
[`Refute.config`](#Refute.config).
